  "keyTakeaway": "The <a style='font-weight: bold;' href='https://mercedesengines.uk/engine/om615-om616-om617'>OM616</a>/OM617 built Mercedes' \"will run forever\" diesel reputation — but the OM651's \"Black Death\" injector story reversed that perception for a generation. The OM654 has largely restored it. The M156/M157/M177 lineage remains AMG's defining V8 story."
